title: "gfatk"
type: software
version: 0.5.1
date-released: "2026-09-21"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22870218
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tolkit/gfatk"
url: "https://github.com/tolkit/gfatk"
abstract: >-
  A command line toolkit to explore, extract, linearise and resolve plant
  mitochondrial assembly graphs (GFA), including read-phased resolution of
  repeat-rich graphs into circular genomes.
keywords:
  - GFA
  - assembly graph
  - mitochondrial genome
  - genome assembly
